   normal-flow element while the shell was changed by compact rules.  The
   result was the collapsed rail occupying the first block and the main
   workspace starting underneath it.

   Keep 861-980px on the same fixed-sidebar model as wider desktop widths.
   The task detail remains the existing <=1280px overlay, so no right-side
   workspace reservation is added here.
